    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vois ces Grelaçon ? Je les ai rassemblés\npour réaliser mon rêve !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200076006F0069007300200063006500730020004700720065006C006100E7006F006E0020003F0020004A00650020006C00650073002000610069002000720061007300730065006D0062006C00E90073000A0070006F007500720020007200E90061006C00690073006500720020006D006F006E0020007200EA0076006500200021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et mon rêve...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500740020006D006F006E0020007200EA00760065002E002E002E001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est de faire monter ces Grelaçon\nsur un énooorme Séracrawl !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006400650020006600610069007200650020006D006F006E00740065007200200063006500730020004700720065006C006100E7006F006E000A00730075007200200075006E002000E9006E006F006F006F0072006D00650020005300E9007200610063007200610077006C0020002100210021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quel spectacle ça doit être de les admirer\nperchés sur un fier Pokémon Iceberg !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grela !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720065006C0061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as l’air de t’y connaître en Pokémon...\nDu coup, j’ai un truc à te demander.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Montre-moi un Séracrawl assez grand\npour que quatre Grelaçon tiennent dessus !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl m’en faut un de taille XL !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce que tu as trouvé un Séracrawl de taille XL\npour mes quatre Grelaçon ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Montre-moi un Séracrawl de taille XL capable\nde transporter quatre Grelaçon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il n’est pas assez grand... Il en faut un de taille XL\npour que quatre Grelaçon puissent tenir dessus.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, non !\nUn Séracrawl de Hisui, ça n’ira pas du tout !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020006E006F006E00200021000A0055006E0020005300E9007200610063007200610077006C002000640065002000480069007300750069002C002000E700610020006E2019006900720061002000700061007300200064007500200074006F0075007400200021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh là là...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006C00E00020006C00E0002E002E002E001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qu’il est grand !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007520190069006C00200065007300740020006700720061006E006400200021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Baron ? Énorme !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020004200610072006F006E0020003F002000C9006E006F0072006D006500200021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis sûre qu’ils tiendront tous dessus !\nMes bébés, vous êtes prêts ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gre !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ils tiennent tous les quatre sur le dos\ndu Séracrawl !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C00730020007400690065006E006E0065006E007400200074006F007500730020006C00650073002000710075006100740072006500200073007500720020006C006500200064006F0073000A006400750020005300E9007200610063007200610077006C00200021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai toujours voulu voir ça en vrai !\nMon rêve s’est réalisé ! Je suis si heureuse !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vite ! Il faut que je les prenne en photo pour\nmes réseaux ! Le monde doit voir ça !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? HEIN ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F0020004800450049004E0020003F0021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh là là là là là là ! Tous ces partages !\nCes photos sont bien parties pour devenir virales !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apparemment, je n’étais pas la seule à rêver\nde voir ce spectacle !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100700070006100720065006D006D0065006E0074002C0020006A00650020006E201900E9007400610069007300200070006100730020006C00610020007300650075006C0065002000E00020007200EA007600650072000A0064006500200076006F0069007200200063006500200073007000650063007400610063006C006500200021001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grâce à ton Séracrawl de taille XL, j’ai pu partager\nma passion pour ces deux espèces de Pokémon<U+0010><U+0001>븀\navec un max de gens ! Merci beaucoup !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grâce à ton Séracrawl Baron, j’ai pu partager\nma passion pour ces deux espèces de Pokémon<U+0010><U+0001>븀\navec un max de gens ! Merci beaucoup !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
